    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> be the sum of the numbers appeared when two fair dice are rolled and let the probability that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;are in geometric progression be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mn>48</mn></mfrac></math>. Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is",
